"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nIntroduced in 4.8 dev3, confirmed dev1 and 2 do not have the issue.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev3.mono - macOS Tahoe (26.4.0) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple A18 Pro (Apple9) - Apple A18 Pro (6 threads) - 8.00 GiB memory - CoreAudio (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nTrying to extend a class from a preloaded const no longer works.\nThis has been a valid pattern until 4.8 dev3, for when you don't want to clutter global scope with useless classes (plugins especially, all of mine are broken in dev3)\n\n```gdscript\nclass_name MyClass\nextends MyClassBase\nconst MyClassBase = Global.MyClassBase\n#const MyClassBase = preload(\"x\") # this doesn't work either\n```\n\n`Error at (1, 9): Could not find base class \"MyClassBase\".`\n\nThe following actually compiles, but it throws an error because of an empty field in ProjectSetting.get_global_class_list()\n\n```gdscript\nclass_name MyClassGlobal\nextends Global.MyClassBase\n```\n`  ERROR: Class name cannot be empty.`\n\nThis class name error was introduced in 4.6 I believe, and was why I moved to the first const method that both compiled and did not throw errors.\n\nAn odd inconsistency that it compiles but the local const preload won't\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nsee above\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[extends-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30867537/extends-mrp.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122220/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122220/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}